  "dialogue_history": [
    {
      "text": "Oh, yes.\ufffdOne of DAD\u2019s friends lives in town.\ufffdPROF. BIRCH is his name.\ufffdHe lives right next door, so you should\ufffdgo over and introduce yourself.",
      "npc": null,
      "location": "Unknown",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-13T12:56:11.755839"
    },
    {
      "text": "Um, um, um!\ufffdIf you go outside and go in the grass,\ufffdwild POK\u00e9MON will jump out!",
      "npc": null,
      "location": "Unknown",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-13T12:56:49.065502"
    },
    {
      "text": "JOHNNY\u2019s HOUSE",
      "npc": null,
      "location": "Unknown",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-13T12:56:55.548258"
    },
    {
      "text": "PROF. BIRCH\u2019S POK\u00e9MON LAB",
      "npc": null,
      "location": "Unknown",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-13T13:01:31.629105"
    },
    {
      "text": "It\u2019s a book that\u2019s too hard to read.",
      "npc": null,
      "location": "Unknown",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-13T13:01:59.272488"
    },
    {
      "text": "It\u2019s crammed with books on POK\u00e9MON.",
      "npc": null,
      "location": "Unknown",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-13T13:02:10.622483"
    },
    {
      "text": "It\u2019s a PC used for research.\ufffdBetter not mess around with it.",
      "npc": null,
      "location": "Unknown",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-13T13:04:54.320455"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hunh? PROF. BIRCH?\ufffdThe PROF\u2019s away on fieldwork.\ufffdErgo, he isn\u2019t here.\ufffdOh, let me explain what fieldwork is.\ufffdIt is to study things in the natural\ufffdenvironment, like fields and mountains,\ufffdinstead of a laboratory.\ufffdThe PROF isn\u2019t one for doing desk work.\ufffdHe\u2019s the type of person who would\ufffdrather go outside and experience\ufffdthings than read about them here.",
      "npc": null,
      "location": "Unknown",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-13T13:08:54.971968"
    },
    {
      "text": "The PROF isn\u2019t one for doing desk work.\ufffdHe\u2019s the type of person who would\ufffdrather go outside and experience\ufffdthings than read about them here.",
      "npc": null,
      "location": "Unknown",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-13T13:09:29.121696"
    },
    {
      "text": "If you use a PC, you can store items\ufffdand POK\u00e9MON.\ufffdThe power of science is staggering!",
      "npc": null,
      "location": "Unknown",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-13T13:13:46.032312"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, hello. And you are?\ufffd\u2026 \u2026 \u2026 \u2026 \u2026 \u2026 \u2026 \u2026 \u2026\ufffd\u2026 \u2026 \u2026 \u2026 \u2026 \u2026 \u2026 \u2026 \u2026\ufffdOh, you\u2019re JOHNNY, our new next-door\ufffdneighbor! Hi!\ufffdWe have a daughter about the same\ufffdage as you.\ufffdOur daughter was excited about making\ufffda new friend.\ufffdOur daughter is upstairs, I think.",
      "npc": null,
      "location": "Unknown",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-13T13:14:24.277460"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, yes.\ufffdOne of DAD\u2019s friends lives in town.\ufffdPROF. BIRCH is his name.\ufffdHe lives right next door, so you should\ufffdgo over and introduce yourself.",
      "npc": null,
      "location": "Unknown",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-13T13:16:56.569666"
    },
    {
      "text": "Um, um, um!\ufffdIf you go outside and go in the grass,\ufffdwild POK\u00e9MON will jump out!",
      "npc": null,
      "location": "Unknown",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-13T13:17:44.366122"
    },
    {
      "text": "It\u2019s dangerous if you don\u2019t have\ufffdyour own POK\u00e9MON.",
      "npc": null,
      "location": "Unknown",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-13T13:17:47.045958"
    }
  ],
